  "definition": "Billing Requirements for Community-Based Behavioral Health Services",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-06-10",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6344) #9311, eff 11-5-08; ss by #12206, eff 6-10-17 (from He-C 6344.17)",
